1	// 訂單取消＋通知的薄 HTTP API。程序內記憶體儲存（不保證重啟持久性）；每 request 一行 logs.jsonl；/metrics 文字格式。
2	// 通知走 Channel → NotificationWorker → POST 到 fake sink（OC_SINK_URL）。故障注入由 OC_FAULTS 指定的 JSON 檔提供，只供演練。
3	using System.Text.Json;
4	using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
5	using System.Threading.Channels;
6	using OrderCancel.Domain;
7	
8	var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
9	builder.Logging.ClearProviders();
10	var runDir = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("OC_RUN_DIR") ?? "runs/default";
11	Directory.CreateDirectory(runDir);
12	var versionFile = Path.Combine(AppContext.BaseDirectory, "VERSION");
13	var version = File.Exists(versionFile) ? File.ReadAllText(versionFile).Trim() : (Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("OC_VERSION") ?? "unknown");
14	var faults = Faults.Load(Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("OC_FAULTS"));
15	var store = new OrderStore();
16	var metrics = new Metrics();
17	var log = new JsonlLog(Path.Combine(runDir, "logs.jsonl"), version);
18	var channel = Channel.CreateUnbounded<Notification>();
19	builder.Services.AddSingleton(store); builder.Services.AddSingleton(metrics); builder.Services.AddSingleton(log); builder.Services.AddSingleton(faults);
20	builder.Services.AddSingleton(channel);
21	builder.Services.AddHostedService<NotificationWorker>();
22	var app = builder.Build();
23	// 例外中介層：任何未處理例外寫一行 log（型別、訊息、request_id）並回 500；OOM 這類也會留在 logs.jsonl 與 stderr。
24	app.Use(async (ctx, next) =>
25	{
26	    try { await next(); }
27	    catch (Exception ex)
28	    {
29	        var rid = ctx.Request.Headers["X-Request-Id"].FirstOrDefault();
30	        try { log.Write(new { level = "ERROR", @event = "unhandled_exception", request_id = rid, path = ctx.Request.Path.Value, exception = ex.GetType().FullName, message = ex.Message }); } catch { }
31	        try { Console.Error.WriteLine($"[unhandled] {ex.GetType().FullName}: {ex.Message} path={ctx.Request.Path} request_id={rid}"); } catch { }
32	        if (!ctx.Response.HasStarted) { ctx.Response.StatusCode = 500; await ctx.Response.WriteAsync("{\"ok\":false,\"reason\":\"internal_error\"}"); }
33	    }
34	});
35	log.Write(new { level = "INFO", @event = "startup", faults_loaded = faults.Any, sink = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("OC_SINK_URL") });
36	
37	app.MapGet("/health", () => Results.Ok(new { ok = true, version }));
38	app.MapGet("/ready", () => Results.Ok(new { ready = true, version }));   // 記憶體儲存無外部依賴；readiness＝程序起來
39	app.MapPost("/orders", async (HttpRequest req) =>
40	{   // 建單（測試用）：body {id, shipped, paid}
41	    using var doc = await JsonDocument.ParseAsync(req.Body); var r = doc.RootElement;
42	    var id = r.GetProperty("id").GetString()!;
43	    var order = new Order(r.TryGetProperty("shipped", out var s) && s.GetBoolean(), r.TryGetProperty("paid", out var p) && p.GetBoolean(), false);
44	    store.Put(id, order);
45	    return Results.Ok(new { id, order });
46	});
47	app.MapGet("/orders/{id}", (string id) => store.TryGet(id, out var o) ? Results.Ok(new { id, order = o }) : Results.NotFound());
48	app.MapPost("/orders/{id}/cancel", async (string id, HttpRequest req) =>
49	{
50	    var t0 = DateTime.UtcNow;
51	    string? payload = null;
52	    if (req.ContentLength > 0) { using var sr = new StreamReader(req.Body); payload = await sr.ReadToEndAsync(); }
53	    if (faults.RetainPayloads) Retained.Keep(id, payload);   // 演練注入：把每筆 request body 留在記憶體，無上限
54	    var rid = req.Headers["X-Request-Id"].FirstOrDefault() ?? Guid.NewGuid().ToString("N")[..12];
55	    var runId = req.Headers["X-Run-Id"].FirstOrDefault();
56	    var actor = req.Headers["X-Actor"].FirstOrDefault();
57	    if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(actor))
58	    {
59	        metrics.Inc("cancel_requests_total", "unauthorized");
60	        log.Write(new { level = "WARN", @event = "cancel", request_id = rid, run_id = runId, order_id = id, result = "unauthorized" });
61	        return Results.Json(new { ok = false, reason = "unauthorized", request_id = rid }, statusCode: 401);
62	    }
63	    if (!store.TryGet(id, out var before))
64	    {
65	        metrics.Inc("cancel_requests_total", "not_found");
66	        log.Write(new { level = "WARN", @event = "cancel", request_id = rid, run_id = runId, order_id = id, result = "not_found" });
67	        return Results.Json(new { ok = false, reason = "not_found", request_id = rid }, statusCode: 404);
68	    }
69	    var result = Cancellation.Cancel(before);
70	    bool transitioned = Cancellation.Transitioned(before, result);
71	    string outcome; int status;
72	    if (before.Shipped) { outcome = "rejected_shipped"; status = 409; }          // BR-02，不通知（NC-03）
73	    else if (transitioned) { outcome = "ok"; status = 200; store.Put(id, result.Order); }
74	    else { outcome = "idempotent"; status = 200; }                               // BR-04／NC-02，不通知
75	    metrics.Inc("cancel_requests_total", outcome);
76	    if (transitioned)
77	    {
78	        metrics.Inc("transitions_total");
79	        var n = new Notification(Guid.NewGuid().ToString("N"), id, rid, runId, "order_cancelled", result.RefundRequested);
80	        metrics.Inc("notify_enqueued_total");
81	        if (faults.SyncNotify)
82	            await NotificationWorker.SendOnce(n, metrics, log, Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("OC_SINK_URL") ?? "http://127.0.0.1:5081/notify");   // 演練注入：在請求路徑上同步等接收端
83	        else
84	            await channel.Writer.WriteAsync(n);
85	    }
86	    var lat = (DateTime.UtcNow - t0).TotalMilliseconds;
87	    metrics.ObserveLatency(lat);
88	    log.Write(new { level = status == 200 ? "INFO" : "WARN", @event = "cancel", request_id = rid, run_id = runId, order_id = id, actor, result = outcome, transitioned, refund_requested = result.RefundRequested, latency_ms = Math.Round(lat, 1), queue_depth = channel.Reader.Count });
89	    return Results.Json(new { ok = status == 200, transitioned, refund_requested = result.RefundRequested, reason = status == 200 ? null : outcome, request_id = rid, order = status == 200 ? result.Order : before }, statusCode: status);
90	});
91	app.MapGet("/metrics", () => Results.Text(metrics.Render(channel.Reader.Count, version), "text/plain"));
92	app.Run();
93	
94	record Notification(string NotificationId, string OrderId, string RequestId, string? RunId, string Kind, bool RefundRequested, int Deferrals = 0);
